{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:56:48+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:56:48+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Befesa S.A.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Waste Management","country":"Luxembourg","city":"Luxembourg","website":"https://www.befesa.com","employees":1639,"summary":"Befesa S.A. offers environmental recycling services to the steel and aluminum industries in the European, Asian, and North American markets. It operates in two segments, Steel Dust Recycling Services and Aluminium Salt Slags Recycling Services. The Steel Dust Recycling Services segment collects and recycles crude steel dust; sells waelz oxide to zinc smelters; and treats crude steel dust; produces stainless steel by electric arc furnace or other metallurgical processes; and galvanization residues, as well as offers refining, logistics, administration, and advisory services. The Aluminium Salt Slags Recycling Services segment recycles salt slags; spent pot linings, a hazardous residue generated by primary aluminum producers; and recovers and sells salt, aluminum concentrate, and aluminum oxides. This segment also collects and recycles aluminum scrap and other aluminum residues, such as aluminum dross, shavings, cuttings, and aluminum concentrates; and produces secondary aluminum alloys for automotive and construction industries. The company also provides logistics, and waelz oxide and aluminum waste treatment services, as well as develops projects and technology. Befesa S.A. was founded in 1987 and is based in Luxembourg, Luxembourg.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Befesa S.A. offre des services de recyclage environnemental aux industries de l’acier et de l’aluminium sur les marchés européens, asiatiques et nord-américains. Elle opère dans deux segments, Steel Dust Recycling Services et Aluminium Salt Slags Recycling Services. Le secteur des services de recyclage de la poussière d'acier recueille et recycle la poussière d'acier brute; vend de l'oxyde de waelz aux fonderies de zinc; traite la poussière d'acier brute; produit de l'acier inoxydable par four à arc électrique ou par d'autres procédés métallurgiques; et les résidus de galvanisation, ainsi que des services de raffinage, de logistique, d'administration et de conseil."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1480000000,"shares_outstanding":39999998,"trailing_pe":17.370892,"forward_pe":13.200613,"price_to_book":2.0836854,"ev_to_ebitda":8.532,"ev_to_revenue":1.725,"dividend_yield":0.0287,"payout_ratio":0.4685,"beta_yahoo":null},"targets":{"current_price":37.0,"mean":43.2,"median":43.0,"high":55.0,"low":36.0,"n_analysts":10,"reco_mean":1.5,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-29"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-06-17","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.0541,"institutions_pct":0.64429003,"institutions_float_pct":0.68114,"institutions_n":200,"institutions":[],"funds":[{"name":"DFA INVESTMENT DIMENSIONS GROUP INC-DFA Intl Small Cap Value PORT.","pct":0.0076,"shares":302591,"value":11195867,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0},{"name":"Fidelity Investment Trust-Fidelity Series International Small Cap Fund","pct":0.0069999998,"shares":280700,"value":10385900,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.97540003},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0068,"shares":270031,"value":9991147,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0136},{"name":"Bridge Builder Trust-Bridge Builder International Equity Fund","pct":0.0062,"shares":248623,"value":9199051,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.45069999},{"name":"Fidelity Investment TRT-Fidelity Intl Small Cap Opportunities Fd.","pct":0.0047999998,"shares":192617,"value":7126829,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":1.7628},{"name":"HARBOR FUNDS-Harbor International Fund","pct":0.0047,"shares":186069,"value":6884553,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.034},